Which compiler error occurs when compiling the following subclass?

```java
class VehicleBase {
    private int engineId = 99;
}
class SportsCar extends VehicleBase {
    void displayId() {
        System.out.println(super.engineId);
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new SportsCar().displayId();
    }
}
```

What does the following snippet print when accessing a hidden instance variable with super?

```java
class TierOne {
    int count = 10;
}
class TierTwo extends TierOne {
    int count = 20;
    void printCounts() {
        System.out.println(this.count + " " + super.count);
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new TierTwo().printCounts();
    }
}
```

